# "one or more" (CR 614.1a) is a limit, not a floor: an Astral Cornucopia cast with X of 0 would enter with no charge
# counter, so there is nothing for the Annex to add one to and it enters bare. And the Annex replaces charge counters
# only: a Walking Ballista cast with X of 1 enters with its one +1/+1 counter, not two.

